{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1483,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00bbe68a9b178d0c2c8cbcc9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看吧～\r\n我好像还能再变得更强唷～",
      "source_fingerprint": "809809778c22308b72ae29381d67dbe50976169a2bb8e54271115ca36e13e364",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bfec23c8edee354b3e2daea8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是奇锐骏唷～\r\n一点一滴地努力吧～",
      "source_fingerprint": "13ec231abe680c78acc2eb73087a0e66a598305aa6b3d83fee407f830b2149c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:297ebc901f95636c252f8b5d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "坚持就是力量……\r\n实实在在地前进吧～",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd1c78c36cded813648ee2e7f2efe17fcf9dd4cdf1dcf2502c4271af6d9b67e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80328024d6353b2467eed7b7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我能成为大家的助力吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "85f7e0178af75768709e3ccc08ff3d82492cd073988acb9c0acf6662438ab8f4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d984a4b20e8e9779522a8765",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉我能帮上很多忙呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ec169b869759e7c9881467119e265847fa2d27c74d09c6359f7621e6d6676de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e33152516aba56d8c7989c4e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "さあ、開演だよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2179619b1a4f14a12f61ea1a571f4b307400045ad7cfeecc4500fe063ba4cdc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8c2e8480167e1e5becde661",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "私たちは志を同じくするデュオ。\r\n肩を並べ、奏でよう…2人の、\r\n胸躍るメロディーアを！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e66c9677fcc8f88ca8b2bb9ce0599ffdacfdaa4b1bfb517a3c25592c865d0567",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82b975dd7864f7805de83a34",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってくるよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c610de3103e5147b4065907c46eb88627152f3bd4af66f90f05d962928d73d0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4fb2d8786e36e808b037319",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "帰ったよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f10f778eca11fc717905b54542e3dbebee04e939105a514643630771473b714",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08b1e28b0ed38bdb1c4837bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "サルサよりも情熱的な君の音色…\r\nいい！もっと聴かせて！\r\nもっと満たしておくれ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "854a20ae127fc3a415c1bd132572099df986547a34fb00c001a3da3d04aa00bd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e06db6355d7351d63b017afe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "君が奏でてくれたヴァイオリン、\r\n恋しくて恋しくてたまらない！\r\n私の心を奪った罪は重いよ…ふふ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6bb692865bb033b03db81c1ea2ad98de30c4db1afcb96fc682dc0e7571d5d562",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d31fd71121ac0fc6d0bb65f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "プワァ～～～～…嗚呼。\r\nお正月に華を添える、\r\n越天楽の雅な音色よ…ベネ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6998fe49345e62fbb3b24894e2321f3e48a8b021e1f6f4c3dea47b14668a07bf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81a58b2e1b3c79a958eb8991",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "渡したチョコを、1人で\r\n食べてはいけないよ。その愛を\r\n口元に運ぶのは、私の役目さ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "61b3c98162d1f38e047dce56da976bec55e4ff61275993d3e224edfb7f7a6ed7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33709a505804c0ed4fdca761",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "なんてことだ、君に贈る100本の\r\nバラが霞む…。だって目の前に、\r\n最高の一輪が咲いてるのだから。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d592a4491e610f61fa079ef7d67eabc2f482af341119547162b4b8d8a13d5c6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce0ad65b22d78db482875769",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "轟く天の川の水流、恐ろしくも\r\n美しい音色！この激情を、\r\nすぐ譜面に残さねば！",
      "source_fingerprint": "042d2c912eaa237bd70db917f6b85cfd901ddf06b0294ba4b933393da3490325",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:940f44d740e72db44f940214",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ハロウィンの賑わいは、\r\n他所に任せようじゃないか。\r\n私たちは惑う魂に、レクイエムを。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2d9cae9e05b64e1864da2f5f9861bf84b22f3f20998cf6d7f620500f7ca92e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ce116dd7fc8397c3c1a3b41",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "さあ、盛大にサンタを出迎えよう！\r\nアドルナメンテに、金色のベルを\r\n鳴らそう！シャンシャンシャーン♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "584668073536ed882bafe79f0ac7761f637d4268f623eb8ba1ff91f4674329e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:825f09f321dc680d38e1dfb5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "煌めくツリーを見た時、\r\n君の心臓はどんなリトモを刻む？\r\n聴かせて…余すことなく、君の音を",
      "source_fingerprint": "67264f6b5bc3888f0db35f1388fc8525ec185b807da4a4b9fe31c24c359b28da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0fbdc5c4cde5946edebeb89b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "私たちの勝利だ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d7481454d0d2c5a1e0df7c82a3ecb40ec3b5d6595f546dba768445399c04aa3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a35434c9a351830f0a5597f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "カウントダウン・オーケストラの\r\nチケットがここに2枚。記念すべき\r\n瞬間は、君の隣じゃないとね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8132718ae74b1c7a230ae3304c50f7a61efdc3e8b11e2e50a9f154f9b59c0e89",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18b54ff05d2d1612d37dbd4d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "誕生日おめでとう！\r\n鼓笛隊に声をかけてあるんだ。\r\nバースデーマーチ、是非楽しんで！",
      "source_fingerprint": "87a5e85b3f74da32a99c8668cc645cca9c39d8d62274fd1776aa2c95494b1a85",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:269725addb99765b0ff0c7d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "グラッツェ。君が生まれた日、\r\n世界に眩い音色が増えたんだ。\r\n愛おしいムジカを…ありがとう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f36d67c25792d35db9962a1542b1c7bc66d9f480beaaa5f3c2519830bd9e3907",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0ab366ca8167a75159ebf4d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ははっ、グラッツェ！君の祝福が、\r\n何よりも嬉しいよ！さあ、どんな\r\n音色で祝ってくれるのかな！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a6fa5bfc80daf64ad539649887c61c0dd79ee35394e1ecd8455b2e92ecc4042",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4039c56baca4e463f3d4032",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "バースデーソングを聴かせて。\r\n君の甘い歌声で、他の音が\r\n聞こえなくなるくらい、ね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "15d9d335274957f79895480fdfbe2c8b5d07b119e559e1f3119e0051e44216db",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f52b45f3c85ac8fd37ea169e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "報せが届いているよ。\r\nゆっくり2人で見ようか。",
      "source_fingerprint": "23756cb1ff987bb459f95d12bbe64460f4dcd0ca18cfdacb6242324940f57bc3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d969a5357e4d1a99048212d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "プレゼントが来てるよ、開けよう！\r\n君の喜ぶ顔を見せておくれ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "21b4beb86329324ed6d925d2833c3853ae70ea328022f989acee9e6d63ddd32f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6fcea0f28e81c273e5b9e044",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ミッション達成だね。\r\nコングラットゥラツィオーニ！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b6350d66a650b254286cab4a66f007b3562d514891a5af9716689f1adfdf983",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4987f99cbbdd6d8fc4f6d798",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "そろそろイベントが始まるみたいだ\r\n愉快な催しになるといいね！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2bb98da32d3d09be3a8a3459b3072a9a605593ad5a48293e6b030e5c57bde40",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c2e6af22e0e7c03fea96331",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "イベントが始まったよ、\r\nほら向かおう！\r\nヴィーヴォ、ヴィーヴォ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7041381c7f4be35ab1c965f978212e2a72822f31bb33e579df431ec80d78166",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a16b8d5c9fa36e98dad070a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "次の課題だね…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7ac978aab53d7998bbec3623078ddf4e8c1b438efe0d28bf0b8abd89c9a9536",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9eaaaa8d6e9f61401948cb40",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "名鑑レベルが上がったよ。\r\nブラーヴォ！おめでとう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a98dc3b2c4bfed482dca20d81aa8f1349fd1bfa2033953d7ace460312a9c5a86",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d3654d34c33731c6ecc4602",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "実に惜しかった！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b503530382ec5795e70866044328b8d3df59df720b0251bc8e69d8e8f3cb3825",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d759e5ecce26a4b722dcdde",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最高のフィナーレだ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "83d6b805e72588ce0615d6f8b68c198915cdb7e0238d08726c2f1b719d5a13c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cff6d5ca3a191b13bd772ee3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "次の課題だね…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7ac978aab53d7998bbec3623078ddf4e8c1b438efe0d28bf0b8abd89c9a9536",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df48e8c3921aab7fe38cd978",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "実に惜しかった！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b503530382ec5795e70866044328b8d3df59df720b0251bc8e69d8e8f3cb3825",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5238feb33ea5ebde804406ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ハイスコア更新だね！",
      "source_fingerprint": "692177dae0694bdf8aa36b8f682d26e6e133d9e0ff526b2c7f0e4b8685a7b084",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23a582ece8d6fd502454c795",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただ音に身を預けて。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd52bda23c5fdc5a2ed4f6c980963301736386318538c0429039e58185396f75",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b97c00f2bf2c0db989a4a96a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "名鑑レベルが上がったよ。\r\nブラーヴァ！おめでとう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c41dbd26fafa89f9926a84153b2e890b73c49396e0547ffdfdfad99808091f7b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "10121"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8046bf66248cd13b4ad77f39",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a5cb9c42e49f7be82ffdd50",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "本番に向けトレーニングに励もう。\r\n喝采は私たちのものだ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "09dc5cfd0b87be7f26136321350747d8f9882aea32d6f4cbdb4cb3cc8aee820e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28b6841aa34bdff475c7e6e3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ふふっ、ウマ娘たちが織り成す\r\n日々…どんな音色がするのかな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1feb500dcfd0f765eb0b5a3839a13692d1eea407701ae1156dae5f1119fadabe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "110001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:acde53f804157217e535a5d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "レースほど沸き立つ協演はない。\r\nさあ、ファンファーレを鳴らそう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "924b0a50f8cf1eaea2658a251b9a5dcb92c92ae4324b00db899c7985abcaff8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "110002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08d65e972094632b6e99dae2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ウマ娘、プリティーダービー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0cfce02d59976c4a687f79d00d7894df0b5a6c879fbee1d653e3f267a88ff06d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1fc2e033eb50d398ba2a4077",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "おお、湧き出る響きよ！\r\n新しい音色の誕生だ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7427d117d30ce9deb6077462b3444dde6bb1a615e3cd31dd00e2a2acd98905a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
